{"3664160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Who's Hungry?", "steam_appid": 3664160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/64a5643aa1b5d9400f0e90554d893cb1.avif?t=1764870214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras_big/64a5643aa1b5d9400f0e90554d893cb1.webp?t=1764870214 width=1560 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a robot invasion that wiped out most humans from existence, a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >human calls to <strong>DELIVERYCIOUS</strong>, one of the few food delivering services left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a <strong>Delibot</strong> from the same company, must venture to another planet to deliver your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >food. Explore a kilometric building where all kinds of bots will try to steal your food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/c6b20bc6e68829723ad15ed498cf1328.avif?t=1764870214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras_big/c6b20bc6e68829723ad15ed498cf1328.webp?t=1764870214 width=1560 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story while fighting with creatures beyond the comprehension of your little robot mind in this randomized</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > RPG where you'll sweat for each roll of your attacks, collect <strong>Locacolas</strong> to trade them for upgrades and items to help</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you fight, WORK FOR THAT GOOD REVIEW <strong>DELIBOT</strong>, YOU CAN DO IT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/0e0a0ff4289313c62d39ff5b2af9f5e6.avif?t=1764870214\" width=1124 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex story where you'll get soaked into the mystery of an invasion, the survivors and your place in the cold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > world you live in. Survive and see what the mystery of your own existence guides you. <strong>Find yourself. Look deeper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/8faa9867d7a19cc76afe24cf6a3588a1.poster.avif?t=1764870214\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/8faa9867d7a19cc76afe24cf6a3588a1.webm?t=1764870214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>And remember! Customer is always right.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/64a5643aa1b5d9400f0e90554d893cb1.avif?t=1764870214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras_big/64a5643aa1b5d9400f0e90554d893cb1.webp?t=1764870214 width=1560 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a robot invasion that wiped out most humans from existence, a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >human calls to <strong>DELIVERYCIOUS</strong>, one of the few food delivering services left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a <strong>Delibot</strong> from the same company, must venture to another planet to deliver your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >food. Explore a kilometric building where all kinds of bots will try to steal your food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >